WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.301
Mrs. Rock: Happy birthday, Coby!

2
00:00:12.302 --> 00:00:16.193
Coby: Thanks, Mom.

3
00:00:16.194 --> 00:00:23.464
Mrs. Rock: Here's your birthday present.

4
00:00:23.465 --> 00:00:26.390
Coby: Is it a basketball?

5
00:00:26.391 --> 00:00:30.184
Mrs. Rock: Does it look like a basketball?

6
00:00:30.185 --> 00:00:35.109
Coby: No. It looks like a . . .

7
00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:38.061
Coby: Spy kit!

8
00:00:38.062 --> 00:00:43.302
Thanks, Mom. It's so cool!

9
00:00:43.303 --> 00:00:46.962
Coby: I can't wait to start spying on people.

10
00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:50.874
Mrs. Rock: Oh no! You're not spying on anybody!

11
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:54.482
Coby: What else would I do with a spy kit?

12
00:00:54.483 --> 00:00:58.555
Mrs. Rock: Just pretend to spy on people.

13
00:00:58.556 --> 00:01:02.430
Coby: Pretend to spy on people?

14
00:01:02.431 --> 00:01:05.200
That's no fun.

15
00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:10.024
Mrs. Rock: Or you can use your kit to help someone.

16
00:01:10.025 --> 00:01:11.887
Mrs. Rock: But remember.

17
00:01:11.888 --> 00:01:15.855
No real spying!

18
00:01:15.856 --> 00:01:30.558
Coby: Got it. No real spying.

19
00:01:30.559 --> 00:01:33.609
Mr. Lenny: Is that a spy kit, Coby?

20
00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:37.821
Coby: Yes. I got it for my birthday.

21
00:01:37.822 --> 00:01:42.281
Daisy: What's in it?

22
00:01:42.282 --> 00:01:44.803
Coby: Lots of stuff!

23
00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:47.705
A spy scope and a notebook.

24
00:01:47.706 --> 00:01:50.613
Coby: There's a fingerprinting kit too.

25
00:01:50.614 --> 00:01:57.866
Jim: Cool! Maybe you can use it to stop some bad guys.

26
00:01:57.867 --> 00:02:00.752
Coby: I wish I could do that.

27
00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:03.668
But my mom says no real spying.

28
00:02:03.669 --> 00:02:06.145
Coby: I can only help people with it.

29
00:02:06.146 --> 00:02:08.270
Mr. Lenny: You can help me, Coby.

30
00:02:08.271 --> 00:02:21.147
I can't find my tool belt.

31
00:02:21.148 --> 00:02:22.617
Coby: I see it!

32
00:02:22.618 --> 00:02:24.545
It's near the ladder.

33
00:02:24.546 --> 00:02:27.825
Mr. Lenny: Oh, there it is. Thanks!

34
00:02:27.826 --> 00:02:33.381
Coby: You're welcome.

35
00:02:33.382 --> 00:02:35.810
Daisy: Good thing you had your spy kit.

36
00:02:35.811 --> 00:02:38.438
Daisy: You were a big help to Mr. Lenny.

37
00:02:38.439 --> 00:02:44.646
Coby: Yeah. But I still want to be a real spy.
